            we are to regard each horizontal map in this tower as classifying the potential underlying
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/instanton+sector"} instanton sector
            of an
            = succeed "/" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/extended+Lagrangian"} extended Lagrangian
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/prequantum+n-bundle"} prequantum n-bundle
          %p
